{"execute":{"doc":1,"cmd":{"Write":{"PasteMarkdown":{"text":"Memorandum\n\nTo:¦All studio staff\n\nFrom:¦Priya Raman, Operations Director\n\nDate:¦9 February 2026\n\nSubject:¦Move to the Canal Street office\n\nOur move to the new office at 48 Canal Street is confirmed for the weekend of 7–8 March. This memo sets out what will happen and what we need from each team.\n\n# Before the move\n\n- Pack your desk into the crates provided by 5 pm on Friday 6 March and label each crate with your name and team\n- Back up anything stored only on your laptop; IT will reimage machines on arrival\n- Return library books and shared equipment to the front desk\n\n# Moving weekend\n\nThe removals team will work on Saturday. IT will connect desks, printers and the meeting rooms on Sunday. The building will be closed to staff on both days.\n\n# First week at Canal Street\n\nDesks are unassigned for the first fortnight so that teams can find the layout that works. Building passes will be on your desk on Monday morning, with a short welcome guide.\n\nQuestions can go to the move channel or to me directly. Thank you for your patience while we settle in.\n"}}}}}
